Manual Test Strategy 
1-Validate the logic of the project  (static test)
2-Validate response and status codes for the api ( correctness of all backend endpoints)
3-Verify authentication & authorization (Bearer token + role-based access).
4-Ensure multi-tenancy isolation (users can only access their own tenant’s data unless PLATFORM_ADMIN).
5-Cover positive, negative, boundary, and security scenarios. 
